# The README animation: vhs docs/tapes/demo.tape (or scripts/screens.sh).
Output docs/img/demo.gif
Set Framerate 15
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Source docs/tapes/setup.tape

Sleep 6s
Down
Sleep 1.2s
Down
Sleep 1.5s

# Find an issue by a word in its title, then start it.
Type "/"
Sleep 800ms
Type "dark mode"
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Enter
# Cut on the last step: a real start goes to the new tab from here.
Sleep 6s
Hide
